	(text "LD2410C (Presence) -> ESP32 UART1\nPin1 TX -> GPIO5 (J1 pin4, RX1)\nPin2 RX <- GPIO4 (J1 pin3, TX1)\nPin3 OUT (not connected)\nPin4 GND\nPin5 VCC (5V)"
